      "title": "A TWO\u2010STAGE TECHNIQUE FOR THE <i>IN VITRO</i> DIGESTION OF FORAGE CROPS",
      "abstract": "<jats:p>A simple technique for the determination <jats:italic>in vitro</jats:italic> of the dry\u2010 or organic\u2010matter digestibility of small (0\u00b75 g) samples of dried forages is described. It involves incubation first with rumen liquor and then with acid pepsin. Using 146 samples of grass, clover and lucerne of known <jats:italic>in vivo</jats:italic> digestibility (<jats:italic>Y</jats:italic>), the regression equation <jats:italic>Y</jats:italic>= 0\u00b799 <jats:italic>X\u2013</jats:italic> 1\u00b701 (S.E. \u00b1 2\u00b731) has been calculated, where <jats:italic>X</jats:italic>=<jats:italic>in vitro</jats:italic> dry\u2010matter digestibility. This technique has been used for the study of the digestibilities of plant breeder's material, of the leaf and stem fractions of herbage and of herbage consumed by animals.</jats:p>",
